message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below. Status: preregistered simulation study, protocol v1.0 frozen (2026-11-24); all 480 confirmatory runs complete; frozen verdict for the primary hypothesis: invalidated (EXP-001, sign reversal under the EXP-004 robustness rule). Independent preprint draft, not peer-reviewed. Simulated markets only; no claim about real markets. The AI assistant used for development is disclosed in the manuscript and is not an author. Repository URL: [placeholder, not yet published]."
title: "Trend followers, aggressive order flow and volatility clustering in a small simulated limit-order book: a preregistered paired-seed study"
